**Local:** `.designeros/qa-reports/qa-report-{locale}-{YYYY-MM-DD}.md`

**Project-scoped:** Write test outcome artifact for cross-session context:
```bash
{{SLUG_SETUP}}
```
Write to `~/.designeros/projects/{slug}/{user}-{branch}-test-outcome-{datetime}.md`

### Output Structure

```
.designeros/qa-reports/
├── qa-report-{locale}-{YYYY-MM-DD}.md    # Structured report
├── screenshots/
│   ├── initial-us.png                     # en-US landing annotated screenshot
│   ├── initial-es.png                     # es-ES landing
│   ├── issue-001-step-1.png               # Per-issue evidence
│   ├── issue-001-result.png
│   └── ...
└── baseline.json                          # For regression mode
```

Report filenames use the domain and date: `qa-report-myapp-com-2026-03-12.md`

